{
  "slug": "twining",
  "name": "Twining",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent coordination — shared blackboard, decision tracking, and context assembly",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **2 agents**, **2 commands**, **5 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `twining-coordinate` (Discovers agents, delegates tasks, and coordinates multi-agent work through capability matching), `twining-decide` (Records architectural and implementation decisions with rationale, rejected alternatives, and traceability), `twining-dispatch` (Coordinates subagent dispatches through Twining — registers agents, posts delegations, and creates handoffs), `twining-handoff` (Hands off work between agents or sessions via a committed handoff document plus a blackboard pointer), `twining-map` (Builds and queries the Twining knowledge graph — records entities, relations, and code structure), `twining-orient` (Assembles Twining context by gathering prior decisions, warnings, and project state), `twining-review` (Reviews pre-commit state — verifies all significant decisions are recorded and traces decision coverage), `twining-semantic-review` (LLM-judged semantic staleness review of Twining entries — flags decisions and blackboard entries tied to historical context that…), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (2): `twining-aware-worker` (Implementation subagent that uses Twining tools directly — posts findings, records decisions, and assembles context before working), `twining-coordinator` (Coordination subagent for decision archaeology, context assembly, and project state queries)\n- **Commands** (2): `twining-export` (Export Twining state as markdown for context handoff or archival), `twining-status` (Show Twining project coordination status)\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SubagentStop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `twining`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install twining@claude-community` from `daveangulo/twining-mcp` (`plugin`).",
